 ROA > 0","passed":0,"detail":"當期 ROA = -4.9%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $269M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 83.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.69"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":32.08,"default_fair_val":32.08,"premium_pct":104.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":21.7,"pb_forward":19.5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":7.4,"fcf_to_ev":3.18,"fcf_to_mcap":3.4,"liab_to_assets":83.7,"cash_to_assets":18.1,"current_ratio":0.69,"roe":-29.9,"roa":-4.9,"moat":{"ticker":"TBBB","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的品牌定價權相對有限。作為一家折扣零售商，其核心競爭力在於提供低價商品，而非高端品牌溢價。雖然其自有品牌可能具有一定的吸引力，但與頂級消費品牌相比，其品牌忠誠度和議價能力較弱。在面對競爭對手時，BBB Foods 更多依賴價格競爭而非品牌價值來吸引和留住顧客。因此，在品牌定價權方面，其護城河僅為中等水平，尚不足以形成顯著的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' brand pricing power is relatively limited. As a discount retailer, its core competency lies in offering low-priced goods rather than premium brand markups. While its private label brands may have some appeal, its brand loyalty and bargaining power are weaker compared to top-tier consumer brands. When facing competitors, BBB Foods relies more on price competition than brand value to attract and retain customers. Therefore, its moat in terms of brand pricing power is only at a moderate level, not yet sufficient to form a significant competitive advantage."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 作為一家折扣零售商，其業務模式並不依賴專利、特許經營權或嚴格的監管壁壘。其產品線主要是大眾消費品，進入門檻相對較低。公司營運的產業環境並無顯著的技術壁壘或政府保護，這意味著其不受專利或監管保護的影響，但也缺乏這方面的護城河。因此，在專利和監管方面，BBB Foods 的經濟護城河幾乎不存在。","comment_en":"As a discount retailer, BBB Foods' business model does not rely on patents, exclusive franchises, or stringent regulatory barriers. Its product line primarily consists of mass-market consumer goods, with relatively low barriers to entry. The industry environment in which the company operates does not have significant technological barriers or government protection, meaning it is not protected by patents or regulations, but also lacks a moat in this regard. Therefore, BBB Foods' economic moat in terms of patents and regulatory aspects is virtually non-existent."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的客戶轉換成本極低。消費者在購買日常消費品時，通常會選擇價格最低、最方便的購買地點。BBB Foods 的折扣模式吸引的是對價格敏感的客戶群，這些客戶很容易因為更低的價格或更便利的購物體驗而轉向競爭對手。公司缺乏能讓客戶產生高轉換成本的獨特產品、服務或生態系統。因此，在客戶轉換成本方面，BBB Foods 的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"BBB Foods has extremely low customer switching costs. Consumers purchasing everyday necessities typically choose the cheapest and most convenient place to buy. BBB Foods' discount model attracts price-sensitive customers who can easily switch to competitors due to lower prices or a more convenient shopping experience. The company lacks unique products, services, or ecosystems that would create high switching costs for customers. Therefore, BBB Foods' moat in terms of customer switching costs is very weak."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的業務模式不具備網絡效應。網絡效應通常出現在平台型、社交型或市場類型的業務中，用戶越多，產品或服務的價值就越大。BBB Foods 是一家線下零售商，其價值主要來自於商品的供應和價格，而非用戶之間的互動。增加的客戶數量並不會直接提升其商品的價值或吸引更多客戶，因此不存在顯著的網絡效應護城河。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' business model does not exhibit network effects. Network effects typically occur in platform, social, or marketplace businesses where the value of a product or service increases with the number of users. BBB Foods is a brick-and-mortar retailer whose value primarily comes from the supply and price of goods, not from user interactions. An increase in the number of customers does not directly enhance the value of its goods or attract more customers, thus there is no significant network effect moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 作為一家大型折扣零售商，在採購和營運上具有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的採購量使其能夠從供應商處獲得更低的進貨價格，並能將這些成本節省轉嫁給消費者，從而維持其低價策略。此外，規模化的營運有助於攤薄固定成本，提高物流效率。儘管面臨其他大型零售商的競爭，BBB Foods 的規模使其在成本控制方面具有一定的競爭力，構成了中等偏上的護城河。","comment_en":"As a large discount retailer, BBB Foods possesses significant economies of scale in procurement and operations. Its massive purchasing volume allows it to obtain lower wholesale prices from suppliers, passing these cost savings on to consumers to maintain its low-price strategy. Furthermore, scaled operations help spread fixed costs and improve logistics efficiency. Despite competition from other large retailers, BBB Foods' scale gives it a certain competitive edge in cost control, forming an above-average moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的業務主要集中在標準化的零售門店，其地理位置雖然重要，但並非獨一無二或不可複製的資產。公司可能在某些地區擁有較好的店面位置，但這並不能構成長期的、難以逾越的護城河。其競爭對手同樣可以尋找類似的地理位置開設門店。因此，在獨特的地理位置和資產方面，BBB Foods 的護城河非常薄弱，缺乏持久的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' business is primarily focused on standardized retail stores. While its locations are important, they are not unique or irreplicable assets. The company may have good store locations in certain areas, but this does not constitute a long-term, insurmountable moat. Its competitors can similarly seek out similar geographic locations to open stores. Therefore, in terms of unique geography and assets, BBB Foods' moat is very weak, lacking a sustainable competitive advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 在營運效率方面表現尚可，尤其是在成本控制和供應鏈管理上。作為折扣零售商，其生存和發展依賴於高效的營運來維持低成本結構。公司通過精簡流程、優化庫存管理和利用規模採購來實現一定的營運效率。然而，與行業內頂尖的效率標竿相比，BBB Foods 的營運效率可能還有提升空間，其護城河屬於中等水平，能夠支持其業務但不足以形成絕對優勢。","comment_en":"BBB Foods performs adequately in operational efficiency, particularly in cost control and supply chain management. As a discount retailer, its survival and growth depend on efficient operations to maintain a low-cost structure. The company achieves a certain level of operational efficiency through streamlined processes, optimized inventory management, and leveraging bulk purchasing. However, compared to the top efficiency benchmarks in the industry, BBB Foods may still have room for improvement in its operational efficiency. Its moat is at a moderate level, supporting its business but not forming an absolute advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的資本配置能力有待觀察。公司目前的財務狀況顯示出較高的負債和負的股本回報率，這表明過去的資本配置決策可能存在問題。雖然公司產生了正的自由現金流，但如何有效地利用這些現金來償還債務、進行戰略投資或回購股票，將是評估其資本配置能力和未來護城河的關鍵。目前來看，其資本配置能力僅為中等偏弱。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' capital allocation capabilities remain to be seen. The company's current financial situation shows high debt and negative returns on equity, indicating potential issues with past capital allocation decisions. Although the company generates positive free cash flow, how effectively it utilizes this cash to repay debt, make strategic investments, or repurchase shares will be key to evaluating its capital allocation ability and future moat. Currently, its capital allocation capability is only moderately weak."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的客戶留存率受到其折扣零售模式的影響。雖然公司能吸引價格敏感型客戶，但這些客戶的忠誠度通常不高。一旦競爭對手提供更優惠的價格或更好的購物體驗，客戶很容易流失。公司缺乏強大的客戶忠誠度計劃或獨特的產品/服務來鎖定客戶。因此，其客戶留存能力屬於中等偏弱，護城河不夠堅固。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' customer retention rate is affected by its discount retail model. While the company can attract price-sensitive customers, these customers typically have low loyalty. Customers can easily churn if competitors offer better prices or a superior shopping experience. The company lacks robust customer loyalty programs or unique products/services to lock in customers. Therefore, its customer retention capability is moderately weak, and the moat is not sufficiently strong."},"m10_durability":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"BBB Foods 的業務模式在當前市場環境下具有一定的持久性，折扣零售是滿足消費者基本需求的穩定業態。然而，其持久性受到來自線上和線下眾多競爭對手的挑戰。公司需要不斷適應市場變化，優化成本結構，並在價格和購物體驗之間取得平衡，才能維持其業務的長期可持續性。其護城河的持久性屬於中等，面臨較大的外部競爭壓力。","comment_en":"BBB Foods' business model has a certain degree of durability in the current market environment, as discount retail is a stable format for meeting basic consumer needs. However, its durability is challenged by numerous competitors, both online and offline. The company must continuously adapt to market changes, optimize its cost structure, and strike a balance between price and shopping experience to maintain the long-term sustainability of its business. The durability of its moat is moderate, facing significant external competitive pressure."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"BBB Foods 的經濟護城河整體偏弱，主要依賴於規模帶來的成本優勢（M5），但這在折扣零售行業中並非罕見壁壘。其品牌定價權（M1）、客戶轉換成本（M3）、網絡效應（M4）、地理位置（M6）、客戶留存（M9）和持久性（M10）均處於中等或偏弱水平。公司缺乏專利或監管保護（M2），且資本配置能力（M8）和營運效率（M7）有待加強。總體而言，BBB Foods 屬於商品型公司，其競爭優勢易受價格波動和競爭加劇影響，護城河不夠寬闊和深厚。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"BBB Foods' economic moat is overall weak, primarily relying on cost advantages derived from scale (M5), which is not a rare barrier in the discount retail industry. Its brand pricing power (M1), customer switching costs (M3), network effects (M4), geographic location (M6), customer retention (M9), and durability (M10) are all at moderate or weak levels. The company lacks patent or regulatory protection (M2), and its capital allocation (M8) and operational efficiency (M7) need improvement. Overall, BBB Foods can be characterized as a commodity-like business, whose competitive advantages are easily affected by price fluctuations and increased competition, resulting in a moat that is neither wide nor deep.","evidenceHash":"86e88653f3baf652718c9819401a698e87e7cbc4c39a8cc2ed66f9f606d17665","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"86e88653f3baf652718c9819401a698e87e7cbc4c39a8cc2ed66f9f606d17665","currentEvidenceHash":"86e88653f3baf652718c9819401a698e87e7cbc4c39a8cc2ed66f9f606d17665"},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"MXN","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:00:18.972Z","evidenceHash":"9da7be6470e0eafa75acb6f4d50a7acae7f803d659f8dd0c21d05910c6173cdf","mcapFx":{"asOf":"2026-11-08","from":"USD","to":"MXN","fromUsdPerUnit":1,"toUsdPerUnit":0.053207904566302366,"fromObservationDate":"2026-11-08","toObservationDate":"2026-10-30"}},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"MXN","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:00:18.972Z","evidenceHash":"9da7be6470e0eafa75acb6f4d50a7acae7f803d659f8dd0c21d05910c6173cdf"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TBBB.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TBBB.png","website":"https://tiendas3b.com","ceo":"Kamal Anthony Hatoum","full_time_employees":"29202","description":"Through its various subsidiaries, BBB Foods Inc. manages a network of grocery retail outlets throughout Mexico. The company provides a comprehensive selection of merchandise, ranging from essential food and beverages to personal care and household cleaning products, alongside coffee, tea, dessert items, and specialized goods for infants and pets. Customers can find a mix of well-established brands, the company's own private label lines, and specially acquired spot products. These offerings are accessible both at its brick-and-mortar stores and via its digital platform. BBB Foods primarily targets and serves households with low to middle incomes. The company, established in 2004, maintains its headquarters in Mexico City, Mexico.","description_en":"Through its various subsidiaries, BBB Foods Inc. manages a network of grocery retail outlets throughout Mexico. The company provides a comprehensive selection of merchandise, ranging from essential food and beverages to personal care and household cleaning products, alongside coffee, tea, dessert items, and specialized goods for infants and pets. Customers can find a mix of well-established brands, the company's own private label lines, and specially acquired spot products. These offerings are accessible both at its brick-and-mortar stores and via its digital platform. BBB Foods primarily targets and serves households with low to middle incomes. The company, established in 2004, maintains its headquarters in Mexico City, Mexico.","description_zh":"**BBB Foods Inc. (TBBB) 業務營運概述**\n\nBBB Foods Inc. 透過旗下子公司，在墨西哥境內經營一家涵蓋多元商品的連鎖超市網絡。其核心業務聚焦於提供廣泛的民生必需品，包括食品、飲料、個人護理及家用清潔用品。此外，公司亦提供咖啡、茶點、甜點，以及嬰幼兒與寵物專用商品。\n\n商品組合策略上，BBB Foods 結合了知名品牌、自有品牌（Private Label）商品，以及具價格優勢的即期商品（Spot Products）。這些商品可透過實體門市及數位平台（線上通路）購買，主要服務對象為墨西哥的中低所得家庭。公司成立於 2004 年，總部位於墨西哥城。","address":"Av. Presidente Masaryk 8","city":"Mexico City","state":"DF","zip":"11560","country":"MX","phone":"52 55 1102 1200","full_address":"Av. Presidente Masaryk 8, Mexico City, DF 11560, MX","range_52w":"25.84-65.91","year_high":65.91,"year_low":25.84,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":25.84,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-15","name":"Khouri Sami Gabriel","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":175895,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-11","name":"Reich Sapire Rose Nicole Dominique","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":7623,"price":51,"total_val":0.39},{"date":"2026-09-04","name":"Reich Sapire Rose Nicole Dominique","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":7623,"price":50.5,"total_val":0.38},{"date":"2026-08-12","name":"Hatoum Kamal Anthony","title":"director, officer: Chairman & CEO","is_buy":n